<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-24T19:36:55.472Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:36:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Rapid Support Forces have intensified drone strikes, hitting a market in Abyei and killing more than 150 civilians, and have deliberately bombed hospitals in el-Fasher, further limiting medical care. Drought and El Niño are worsening famine risk across war-torn Sudan, adding environmental pressure to the conflict. The United Nations is resuming peace efforts aimed at ending the drone war and easing the humanitarian crisis. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168638&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE83VG1KREE2a1hQT3Q3cDg1Wk1QNkQyTTkxZzFwNXVDb1JiLVJBRW9IMWw4VXlhdHhWRjVkYkZ4cHlJSmxDNWdjN2U3aHBwOFRFTnJaLUZXMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE90UjZEMHJTSmRjVzFrQWQ4SE9ad1FGYTB3ckJzTENRaWZYdUtJcWJta2I2X3p4MlhPUkNUamUxVkJGVFBya1Z0ZzlKQTFnWklpY1g2d3cyVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE92NENPVF9yczZLdThXUDZpbDFCZ3V0SUx2LTBlaW9oa0h2VUF3OGMwVzRZYTFhVE9Xbks3dEpnenpJMHRUOTZadjFHZlY1VWR2M0lKb3Zyd0I?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1Zc0dVWGU2SlJTeDhZYk12X1ZGWGpGVzJVYVFEckpRMjk4clY0SDZobE4zLU5oMzhoQXRXSWFUX2xyLVVfRFlyVGFVb2ctTVdmWHY3aE4wVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE85Sk1Ud3NMbmhhOF9MQVU4TkxuSGdZLWJRWEcxODJWS3N0b1pzSTJZME1rN0s3M3JCTEZ0UUdTZHQzR3NrQkE3R0ROcGFOck9udUhwbnduNGo1QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQS2VIUXB6aVR4Y2EtS1VfTUdwTWluTl8wTm45ejlidldTbExlVmlkY25fcUliRXNVa2lGUl9xcjhmS3ZHc3NjU3dEQTRxcVAwMkF3YmczX0wxT09LbExRQ1ppSTJQdjZ0U1YtZGlOVVpTMERRRTZzMXN3d3MyeS1iZEp2Zld6aWl0VFpCQUFHUDNxRWJUcm1Hbk1vYmlTU0d4bl9ZU0lR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5qZnNNMEhERkY4bGtIN0x0UFl3QWdjWm1oWXZwOEVaeF9pWkZqY1ZhQlpIQVVzUGxxeU9scmdiaHN1UFBDSXo4WUZJdzhYX3Byd1NRWmdrM1pNRm1tUEcwaHluQkwwblU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPd05QVnpyM1N2MkZaeUo5ZnJfRnRwbjFDYkF1VlRibHVZRGhWRXVoVXh1aFNxNmRfU1VMZm44MFQzUTBiWE1NSWtHTkRIS2hxRUQ1YkUyRV9tYmJHYjBSY2RVUmJiXzhycTMxRE9SNy1iWGxRQno5TG0yUnBaLXF0UFRHQk14TE1FNTZoMWpkQ0dDX3c5WHhNa3RmTGd5WXN6WU9UbHlGQXg0Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
